    "font size" : 8.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "academic advising program are to help advisees identify and achieve their academic goals, to promote their intellectual discovery, and to encourage students to take advantage of both in-and out-of class educational opportunities in order that they become self-directed learners and decision makers."
  }, {
